# Entrance Editor

See `docs/entrance-editor.md` and `docs/roadmap-interior-fitout.md` Phase 1.

## Hard

- Call them **entrances**, not “just doors.” Kinds: `door` | `stairs` (extend later).
- **No entrance without a host wall.** Add requires selected wall `#`.
- Sidebar label **Entrance**; kind picked on Add (Door / Stairs).
- **How to open** documented first; single open paths only.
- Portal to `document.body` + `fixed` viewport right — never under `#floorplanner`.
- Field → function row before any new control; one Apply; no dual keys.
- Placing/editing an entrance must **not** move the host wall.
- Hole comes from `wall.items` + `Edge` shape holes (existing pipeline).
